   $q$Which statement best compares the two versions?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Version One shows the race from inside Diego, and Version Two shows a wider view.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Both versions use \"I,\" but Version Two is longer and has more details.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-first-and-third-person"},{"text":"Version One shows more of the crowd, and Version Two shows only Diego's feelings.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-pov-effect"},{"text":"Version One is a drama with lines, and Version Two is a story in prose.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-prose-and-drama"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Version One shows the race from inside Diego, and Version Two shows a wider view.$q$, $q$Version One stays inside Diego's head with his pounding heart, while Version Two adds his father and the surprised swimmer in lane four. Only Version One uses "I," so the claim that both versions use "I" is wrong.$q$, 'draft', '1e39d97b-4fda-56b5-83a2-ff759e4bb067')
